# The enneagonal trapezohedron

The polyhedron `Other.EnneagonalTrapezohedron.polyhedron`: the convex hull of 20 points,
with coordinates in `ℚ(θ)` (`polyEval c θ` is `∑ cᵢ θⁱ`).
-/

namespace Nieuwland.Other.EnneagonalTrapezohedron

/-- `θ`: the largest root of
`64/81 - 256/9 * x ^ 2 + 1168/9 * x ^ 4 + 1760/9 * x ^ 6 - 280 * x ^ 8 + 64 * x ^ 10 + x ^ 12`
in the interval `(1/4, 5/8)` (`realRoot`, `Definitions/Polynomials.lean`). -/
